OL,3,AHome secretary scraps plan for migrant
OL,4,Acare workers already in UK to wait 15
OL,5,Ayears for settlement
OL,6,
OL,7,FShadow home secretary Chris Philp
OL,8,Fdescribes the announcement as a
OL,9,F"U-turn" and warned it could cost
OL,10,Ftaxpayers #10bn
OL,12,FMeanwhile, people arriving by small
OL,13,Fboat will have to wait 20 years for
OL,14,Fsettlement, with a further 10 years for
OL,15,Fthose who have not entered work or
OL,16,Fstudy
OL,18,FILR, also known as settlement, gives a
OL,19,Fperson the right to live, work and
OL,20,Fstudy in the UK for as long as they
OL,21,Flike and apply for benefits if they are
OL,22,Feligible
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/40
