OL,3,ACopilot in deadly Florida jet crash
OL,4,Aidentified in reports as 20-year-old
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne man on the ground sustained a leg
OL,7,Finjury when the aircraft nosedived on
OL,8,Fto a street near Cresthaven, nine miles
OL,9,F(14 km) from President Donald Trump's
OL,10,FMar-a-Lago resort.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/40
